---
description: >-
  Bidirectional self-reference arrows combined with circle markers - at both
  ends, at the destination only, and at the source only - for solid and
  dotted bidirectional lines, autonumber enabled.
config:
  sequence:
    diagramMarginX: 50
    diagramMarginY: 10
---
%%{init: {'theme':'base'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Alice
  participant Bob
  participant Charlie
  Alice()<<->>()Alice: Dual central with bidirectional solid
  Bob()<<-->>()Bob: Dual central with bidirectional dotted
  Charlie<<->>()Charlie: Central at end with bidirectional
  Bob()<<->>Bob: Central at start with bidirectional
